<!-- Migration notes (WPF -> Avalonia):
     - Root xmlns set to https://github.com/avaloniaui; removed redundant child xmlns:x declarations.
     - Style TargetType="T" -> Selector="T" (x:Key values preserved, BasedOn preserved).
     - Inner Style with x:Key="TextBlock" (implicit default) -> Selector="TextBlock" without x:Key
       (Avalonia default style convention).
     - ControlTemplate.Triggers -> nested <Style Selector="^..."> with /template/ Element#Name selectors.
     - Pseudoclass mapping: IsMouseOver->:pointerover, IsPressed->:pressed, IsEnabled=False->:disabled,
       IsChecked=true->:checked, IsChecked=null->:indeterminate, Button.IsDefault=true->:default.
     - MultiTrigger (IsDefault + IsPressed) -> :default:pressed (more specific wins, restoring accent
       BorderBrush that :pressed would otherwise override).
     - MultiTrigger (IsChecked + IsMouseOver) -> :checked:pointerover.
     - Button.IsDefaulted=true could not be converted (no Avalonia pseudoclass) -> NOTE comment.
     - ContentControl.HasContent=true could not be converted (no Avalonia pseudoclass) -> NOTE comment.
     - Style.Triggers DataTriggers binding to control's own IsMouseOver/IsChecked (no RelativeSource,
       interpreted as control state) -> :pointerover / :checked control-level selectors.
     - Property prefixes stripped in Setters (Panel.Background->Background, Border.BorderBrush->BorderBrush,
       FrameworkElement.* -> *, Control.* -> *, UIElement.* -> *, TextElement.* -> *, Shape.* -> *,
       ButtonBase.* -> *, Inline.* -> *). Attached properties (KeyboardNavigation.*, Stylus.*,
       RenderOptions.*) kept as-is.
     - UIElement.Visibility in Setters and literal template attrs -> IsVisible (bool: Visible->True,
       Collapsed/Hidden->False). Path.Visibility bound via BooleanToVisibilityConverter -> Path.IsVisible
       with direct bool binding (converter no longer needed).
     - TemplateBinding paths stripped of class prefixes (Panel.Background->Background, Border.*->*,
       Control.* -> *, FrameworkElement.* -> *, ContentControl.Content->Content, controls:ToolbarButton.Title
       ->Title, controls:ToolbarDropDownButton.Title->Title).
     - ControlTemplate internal control tree and layout preserved.
     - AVLN3000 fix: <Styles.Resources> only accepts keyed resources (IResourceDictionary). Non-keyed
       <Style Selector="..."> elements must be direct children of <Styles>, not inside Resources.
       Keyed styles (x:Key="...") and ControlThemes stay inside Resources. -->
